{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「濑名同学有空的话就拜托了」", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁也想～安洁也想一起去，这样下去我会被学校赶出去的～」", "text_idx": 389, "plain": "「安洁也想～安洁也想一起去，这样下去我会被学校赶出去的～」", "plain_idx": 389, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3599", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……有这么糟糕吗」", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，可不止糟糕，可以说是非常严峻的程度了」", "text_idx": 392, "plain": "「嗯，可不止糟糕，可以说是非常严峻的程度了」", "plain_idx": 392, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3600", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我知道了，我会严厉鞭策你学习的，直到问题从你的耳朵鼻子里溢出来为止」", "text_idx": 394, "plain": "「我知道了，我会严厉鞭策你学习的，直到问题从你的耳朵鼻子里溢出来为止」", "plain_idx": 394, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5588", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……安洁现在可能站在人生的分歧点上！」", "text_idx": 396, "plain": "「……安洁现在可能站在人生的分歧点上！」", "plain_idx": 396, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3601", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我还是自己一个人学习更——」", "text_idx": 398, "plain": "「我还是自己一个人学习更——」", "plain_idx": 398, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3602", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好了，出发了」", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5589", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学抓住安洁的脖子，拖着她走了起来。", "text_idx": 402, "plain": "濑名同学抓住安洁的脖子，拖着她走了起来。", "plain_idx": 402, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊啊啊，爱理同学，清扫道具很寂寞，它们在呼唤安洁！」", "text_idx": 403, "plain": "「啊啊啊啊，爱理同学，清扫道具很寂寞，它们在呼唤安洁！」", "plain_idx": 403, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3603", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「她考试前总是这样，不用在意」", "text_idx": 405, "plain": "「她考试前总是这样，不用在意」", "plain_idx": 405, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5590", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
